    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poisons\" title=\"Poisons\">Poisons</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p>Obah is a nerve agent capable of paralyzing most <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a>. </p><h2><span id=\"Obah_Statistics_.28CL_6.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obah_Statistics_(CL_6)\">Obah Statistics (CL 6)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Atmosphere, Poison </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A creature is exposed to Obah. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +8 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> Each round at the start of the target's turn, as long as the target remains exposed to Obah. </p>",
